      "writtenOn": "2021-02-17T00:54:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Robert asked me to show you how to change this from a resource to a radio hal capability.  A radio hal capability is similar to a resource, except that the setting comes from the hal instead of the resources xml.\n\nI created a doc that steps through how to create one by walking through an existing capability:\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1zUmehYrJy-wMGkb4Ot0Q3kywvZWtVC-0H8YYA-F8Fn8/edit?usp\u003dsharing\u0026resourcekey\u003d0-MlEjtjW2aclsRn4bhD9jLQ\n\nTwo notes:\n1. I suggest using the name CAPABILITY_SIM_PHONEBOOK_IN_MODEM and have it as a non-SystemApi.  2. Also, please tie the capability to the existing reduced feature set flag as seen in the doc.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 128,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 129,
        "endChar": 71
      },
      "revId": "a4921b15d2bc2227660b06eaba1b289d839de54c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
